 writing her book on October 6, 2022. She had possessed the story for a long time before writing it, with a relevant memory indicating that she started writing the book on July 10, 2022. \n\nTo calculate the duration it took her to finish writing the book:\n\n- Start date: July 10, 2022\n- Finish date: October 6, 2022\n\nFrom July 10 to October 6 is approximately 2 months and 26 days.\n\nTherefore, it took Joanna about 2 months and 26 days to finish writing her book.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Joanna finished writing her book. (event_time: 2022-10-06T00:00:00Z)\n  - Joanna possessed the story for a long time before writing it. (event_time: 2022-05-20T19:49:00Z)\n  - Joanna is a writer. (event_time: 2022-09-14T13:43:00Z)\n  - Joanna finished writing her second screenplay recently. (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Joanna's writing is currently consuming her time. (event_time: 2022-04-15T19:37:00Z)\n  - Joanna engages in writing. (event_time: 2022-01-21T19:31:00Z)\n  - Joanna recently started writing a book. (event_time: 2022-07-10T14:34:00Z)\n  - Joanna is proud of finishing the story she wrote. (event_time: 2022-05-20T19:49:00Z)\n  - Joanna has been working on something. (event_time: 2022-05-20T19:49:00Z)\n  - Joanna has writing as a long-term passion. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Joanna watched the thing for which she wrote the book. (event_time: None)\n  - The hard work and determination Joanna put into writing was rewarding (event_time: 2022-10-25T20:16:00Z)\n  - Joanna finished working on her first full screenplay. (event_time: 2022-01-21T00:00:00Z)\n  - Joanna has a strong aptitude for writing. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Joanna recalls the difficult process of finishing her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-05-25T15:00:00Z)\n  - Joanna has been working on a project recently. (event_time: 2022-01-21T19:31:00Z)\n  - Joanna is finding the recent experience of finishing her script a wild ride. (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Joanna uses writing as a way to express her feelings (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n  - Joanna feels she cannot stop writing. (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna explored the theme of love in her writing. (event_time: None)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - book: Joanna finished writing and editing her book last week, exploring themes of sisterhood, love, and chasing dreams. The book had previously been shared with her writers group.\n  - sisterhood: Joanna watched a story exploring themes of sisterhood, love, and chasing dreams, which she recommended. She also finished writing her book last week after many late nights and edits.\n  - dreams: Joanna's book covered sisterhood, love, and chasing dreams; she finished writing and editing it last week. Joanna encourages reaching for dreams.\n  - connection: Joanna is writing a personal story about loss, identity, and connection, which she has had for a long time and is proud to have completed.\n  - writers group: Joanna shared her book with her writers group last week and received great feedback. She recently finished a cute little bookmark for one of the ladies at her writing club.\n  - the last one: Joanna is inspired to write a story about a thirty-year-old woman on a self-discovery journey after a loss, similar to 'the last one'.\n  - people: Joanna shared how rewarding it was to see her written work performed, drawing inspiration from real life and imagination to crea