sed the adoption agency interviews. (event_time: 2023-10-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline contacted her mentor for adoption advice. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline has a dream to adopt and provide a loving home. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline is ready to give all her love to a child through adoption. (event_time: 2023-08-23T15:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline views adoption as a good way to expand one's family (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline applied to adoption agencies this week. (event_time: 2023-08-23T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline is currently researching adoption agencies. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Melanie is asking Caroline for advice on starting the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline offered to help Melanie with adoption if Melanie decides to pursue it (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - council meeting for adoption: Caroline attended a council meeting for adoption last Friday; it was inspiring, emotional, and reinforced her determination to adopt.\n  - kids in need: Melanie's kids made things with clay. Caroline attended a council meeting about adoption, which made her more determined to adopt children in need.\n  - Caroline: Caroline passed adoption agency interviews last Friday. She is excited to build a family by adopting needy kids, viewing adoption as a way to give back, show love, and acceptance.\n  - these kids: Caroline is excited to build a family and give a loving, safe home to 'these kids' through adoption, ensuring they experience love and acceptance.\n  - adoption advice/assistance group: Caroline attended an adoption advice/assistance group this week to get help for her decision to apply to adoption agencies to become a mom.\n  - adoption process: Caroline mentioned an adoption process and Melanie expressed support and asked about what Caroline is excited for regarding it.